<view class="page">
  <view class="headline">对话档案 · 可行性验证</view>
  <view class="hint">在微信多选复制消息，回到这里长按输入框，直接粘贴。追加时也可再次粘贴整段记录。</view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="row"><view class="label">本机对话</view><button class="mini" bindtap="newConversation">＋ 新建对话</button></view>
    <scroll-view scroll-x="true" class="tabs"><view class="tab-list"><view wx:for="{{chatViews}}" wx:key="id" class="tab {{item.current ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectConversation">{{item.title}} · {{item.count}} 行</view></view></scroll-view>
    <view class="row title-row"><input class="title-input" value="{{title}}" bindinput="onTitle" placeholder="为这段对话起名" /><button class="mini" bindtap="saveTitle">保存名称</button></view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="label">追加聊天记录</view>
    <textarea class="editor" value="{{draft}}" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="长按此处，粘贴微信多条消息" maxlength="-1" cursor-spacing="24" />
    <view class="small">待添加 {{incomingCount}} 行 · 本机已保存 {{messageCount}} 行</view>
    <button class="primary" bindtap="appendDraft">保存新增记录</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="label">已保存的对话文字</view>
    <scroll-view scroll-y="true" class="history"><view wx:if="{{!messages.length}}" class="empty">还没有记录。先粘贴聊天文字，再点「保存新增记录」。</view><view wx:for="{{messages}}" wx:key="index" class="line"><text class="line-no">{{index + 1}}</text><text selectable="true">{{item}}</text></view></scroll-view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="label">截图导入通道验证</view>
    <view class="small">仅从相册选择并预览截图。图片不会上传；这一版还不识别文字。</view>
    <button class="secondary" bindtap="chooseScreenshot">从相册选一张截图</button>
    <image wx:if="{{selectedImage}}" class="screenshot" src="{{selectedImage}}" mode="widthFix" />
    <button wx:if="{{selectedImage}}" class="mini remove" bindtap="clearScreenshot">移除预览</button>
  </view>
  <view class="foot">v0.2.0 · 本机保存，增量追加，截图选取；暂不调用模型或 OCR。</view>
</view>
